uake","Complete browser port, maps, runtime source and tests, with the shareware pak0.pak. Code is GPL-2.0; original Quake game data has separate terms and is not relicensed by the code license.",[1383],{"_56":1384,"_26":1368,"_215":1385},"Play Three Quake","Keyboard, mouse and a WebGL-capable browser. The included shareware data covers Episode 1; full-game content is separate.",[1387],{"_56":1388,"_26":1389,"_215":-7},"查看移植署名与作者开发日志","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake#dev-log",[1391,1392,1393,1394],"Open the browser build, start a new single-player game and test the movement and firing controls.","Read the creator’s port credits and dev log alongside the original id Software source reference.","Inspect the browser renderer, game runtime, maps and tests to trace how the existing game was adapted.","Use the included shareware data for Episode 1; a registered full-game data set is separate and must be supplied by its owner.","Mr.doob 将 Claude 列为 Three.js 移植工作的协助者。Quake 的原始设计与实现来自 id Software，本例是 AI 辅助移植，不能表述成 AI 创作了 Quake。README 链接开发记录，但没有明确具体 Claude 客户端。",[1391,1392,1393,1394],{"_56":1404,"_26":1389,"_18":235},{"_56":1384,"_26":1368,"_18":315,"_215":1385},{"_56":1403,"_26":1380,"_215":1381,"_267":268},{"_56":1402,"_26":1375,"_215":1376},[124],"Read the author’s AI and original-game credits","Open the complete browser port","Read the port credits and creator dev log","example:crown-defender-codex","crown-defender-codex","Crown Defender TD 3D · Codex build","在等距视角下操控英雄，抵挡三十波敌人保护城堡，通过升级组合赢得装饰皇冠。","/zh/examples/crown-defender-codex/",{"_20":1406,"_22":1407,"_24":1408,"_114":330,"_96":119,"_254":610,"_251":1462,"_9":1463,"_236":1464,"_19":1465,"_33":1466,"_212":1467,"_205":1468},[1412,1413,1414,1415,1416,1417,1418,1419,1420,1421,1422,1423,1424,1425,1426,1427,1428,1429,1430],{"_54":22,"_58":1407,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":1408,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":330,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_