ex.-Crown-Defender-TD-3D-browser-tower-defense-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","Static browser game. Run python3 -m http.server 8010 and open localhost:8010/index.html; choose Играть (Play). Russian interface. WASD/arrows move; semicolon attacks. Mobile joystick/buttons included. Optional two-player mode requires node server/multiplayer-server.mjs.",[1455],{"_56":1456,"_26":1443,"_215":-7},"查看同一需求下的代理对比",[1458,1459,1460,1461],"Serve the project locally and enter TD Defense.","Read the original requirements and same-brief comparison.","Inspect hero movement, wave progression and upgrade logic.","Change one upgrade and test losing, retrying and saved progress.","Aleksandr-Litvinenko 将此版本归功于 Codex，并公开与相同需求下 Claude Code 版本的比较。作者表示比较针对两种代理最初的实现选择；此仓库提供运行所需的代码和素材。",[1458,1459,1460,1461],{"_56":1471,"_26":1443,"_18":840},{"_56":1451,"_26":1452,"_18":225,"_215":1453},{"_56":1470,"_26":1435,"_267":268,"_215":1448},{"_56":1469,"_26":1443,"_215":1444},[1335,124],"Read the author’s agent attribution","Open the complete Codex game project","Read the same-brief agent comparison","example:magic-carpet-wizard-astra","magic-carpet-wizard-astra","Magic Carpet Wizard · A Thousand Skies","驾驶飞毯掠过微型球形世界，穿越计分圆环、使用三种法术并迎战敌人与首领。本地幽灵竞速支持两人轮流挑战。","/zh/examples/magic-carpet-wizard-astra/",{"_20":1473,"_22":1474,"_24":1475,"_114":330,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":1527,"_9":1528,"_236":1529,"_19":1530,"_33":1531,"_212":1532,"_205":1533},[1479,1480,1481,1482,1483,1484,1485,1486,1487,1488,1489,1490,1491,1492,1493,1494,1495,1496,1497],{"_54":22,"_58":1474,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":1475,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":330,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":252,"_58":253,"_60":254,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":249,"_58":1527,"_60":251,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":198,"_56":241,"_242":243,"_68":1522,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":237,"_68":1519,"_60":236,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":23