开提示、完整会话或人类与模型工作的精确比例。",[1523,1524,1525,1526],{"_56":1536,"_26":1509,"_18":235},{"_56":1517,"_26":1502,"_18":315,"_215":1518},{"_56":1535,"_26":1509,"_267":268,"_215":1514},{"_56":1534,"_26":1509,"_215":1510},[124],"See the creator’s Astra attribution","Open the complete carpet-flight project","Read the creator’s implementation guide","example:sakura-crossing-qwen","3D Sakura Crossing：本地 Qwen 探索原型","探索卡通渲染的日本街区，体验运行中的铁路道口、居民对话、开合桥、可驾驶小车与可游泳河流。",{"_20":120,"_22":1538,"_24":1539,"_114":330,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":1595,"_9":1596,"_236":1597,"_19":1598,"_33":1599,"_212":1600,"_205":1601},[1543,1544,1545,1546,1547,1548,1549,1550,1551,1552,1553,1554,1555,1556,1557,1558,1559,1560,1561,1562],"3D Sakura Crossing: an exploration prototype",{"_54":22,"_58":1538,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":118,"_58":1539,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":330,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":252,"_58":253,"_60":254,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":249,"_58":1595,"_60":251,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":198,"_56":241,"_242":243,"_68":1590,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":237,"_68":1586,"_60":236,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":234,"_58":821,"_60":236,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":232,"_58":320,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":226,"_68":1581,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":224,"_58":315,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":219,"_68":1578,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":217,"_58":218,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":210,"_68":1573,"_60":212,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":203,"_68":1571,"_60":205,"_62":-7},{"_54":198,"_60":199,"_56":200,"_68":1570,"_64":65},{"_54":188,"_60":122,"_56":1566,"_79":1567,"_89":1568,"_33":1569,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_61":375},{"_54":55,"_60":369,"_56":370,"_58":1364,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_60":364,"_56":365,"_68":1563},[1564],{"_56":365,"_26":1565},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing/main/docs/anteprima.gif","Creator-published gameplay animation from the repository README.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/sakura-crossing-qwen.webp","Sakura Crossing gameplay in a cel-shaded Japanese neighbourhood at dusk.","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing",[519],[1572],{"_56":102,"_26":103},[1574],{"_56":1575,"_26":1576,"_215":1577},"查看 Qwen 与作者的开发分工","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing#credits","README explicitly distinguishes locally generated Qwen code from human review, debugging, and extensions. The creator’s linked Reddit build account identifies Claude Code CLI as the harness, not the Claude model.",[1579],{"_56":457,"_26":1569,"_215":1580},"GPL-3.0 source with complete index.html, vendored Three.js, procedural textures, and implementation notes. Run python3 -m http.server 5191 and open localhost:5191/index.html; file:// loading is unsupported. The original author has ended active development. The creator describes an exploration prototype, not a finished campaign; no complete win/loss loop is claimed.",[1582],{"_56":1583,"_26":1584,"_215":1585},"Explore Sakura Crossing","https://danymaniglie-cmyk.github.io/3d-sakura-crossing/","Exploration prototype. WASD walks, Shift runs, mouse drag looks, E talks, F enters/exits the car, and Space/C swims up/down. Touch controls included; mobile performance remains limited.",[1587],{"_56":1588,"_26":1589,"_215":-7},"阅读渲染与实现指南","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing/blob/main/CARTOON.md",[1591,1592,1593,1594],"Explore the browser world on foot, then try the car, river, and moving bridge.","Read the credits and the author’s account of using a local Qwen model through Claude Code CLI.","Inspect CARTOON.md and the complete index.html plus vendored Three.js dependency.","Serve a local copy over HTTP, change one interaction, and verify movement and collisions.","仓库说明代码由本地运行的 Qwen 3.8 27B 生成，再由人手工审查、调试与扩展。作者的开发帖子进一步说明使用 Claude Code CLI 作为执行工具，底层模型为 Qwen。",[1591,1592,1593,1594],{"_56":1