est/main/docs/teaser.webp","A combat frame from the creator’s portrait gameplay animation, fitted without cropping.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/sprout-quest-claude.webp","A small sword-wielding adventurer fights creatures on a forest path, with a portrait mobile touch joystick.","https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest#readme",[519],[1641,1642,1643],{"_56":519,"_26":520},{"_56":102,"_26":103},{"_56":1088,"_26":1089},[1645],{"_56":1646,"_26":1647,"_215":1648},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest#how-it-was-built","README separates the original build from later human playtest/AI iteration; publishes source modules, generated models and runtime assets, plus a prompt summary. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[1650],{"_56":889,"_26":1651,"_215":1652},"https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest","Complete game code, runtime GLBs/sprite atlases, Blender scripts and tests. bun install then bun run dev opens localhost:3000; normal builds use committed art and do not require Blender. No root LICENSE was found, so public source visibility does not establish broad reuse permission.",[1654],{"_56":1655,"_26":1656,"_215":1657},"Play Sprout Quest","https://aibengineering.github.io/sprout-quest/","Author-hosted browser adventure designed for portrait phones, with desktop keyboard controls and localStorage saves.",[1659],{"_56":1660,"_26":1647,"_215":-7},"阅读作者的开发过程",[1662,1663,1664,1665],"Play the portrait-browser prologue and follow its first fight, gathering and forge tasks.","Read the build account to see how human phone playtests guided later Claude Code changes.","Run bun install and bun run dev; inspect the game modules, committed runtime assets and Blender builders.","Change one combat, crafting or story rule with an agent, then replay the affected progression and save flow.","作者称游戏、测试与 Blender 美术流程均由 Claude Code 根据自然语言要求完成；人类负责在手机上试玩并反馈。仓库同时提供运行素材和素材生成脚本，可以研究试玩反馈如何推动后续修改。",[1088],"Custom Canvas 2D + Three.js · TypeS