i.webp","Astra Floor rifle combat against a zombie wave, with health, ammunition and wave counters.","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/issues/96",[1713,948],"ChatGPT",[1715],{"_56":102,"_26":103},[1717],{"_56":1718,"_26":1711,"_215":1719},"查看作者说明的 AI 分工","The repository owner’s submission distinguishes Astra from Antigravity work. The README also credits both tools; no full conversation archive is supplied.",[1721],{"_56":1722,"_26":1723,"_215":1724},"查看完整 FPS 游戏项目","https://github.com/BEROCHLU/astrafloor","Game implementation, procedural models, bundled textures/music and tests. Node.js 22.13+; npm install then npm run dev. Third-party texture credits are documented separately.",[1726],{"_56":1727,"_26":1728,"_215":1729},"Play Astra Floor","https://astrafloor.berochlu.workers.dev/","Desktop WebGL, keyboard and mouse. Wait for INITIALIZING to finish, choose a difficulty, then DEPLOY. WASD moves, mouse aims/fires, R reloads, Q heals, G throws a grenade, and V uses melee. Runs are not saved. The in-app browser could not capture the mouse during review; a normal desktop browser is recommended.",[1731],{"_56":1732,"_26":1711,"_215":-7},"阅读作者的 AI 开发说明",[1734,1735,1736,1737],"Choose Normal difficulty and enter the first wave.","Read the creator’s architecture and model disclosure.","Inspect procedural weapons, enemies and audio implementation.","Tune one weapon or enemy and verify a wave and shop transition.","BEROCHLU 表示 GPT-6 Astra 参与了大量架构、程序化 3D 生成和 Web Audio 合成，Antigravity 2.0 完成其他实现与迭代打磨。作者没有宣称这是一次提示完成的作品。","Three.js · TypeScript (React UI)",[1734,1735,1736,1737],{"_56":1748,"_26":1711,"_18":235},{"_56":1727,"_26":1728,"_18":315,"_215":1729},{"_56":1747,"_26":1723,"_267":268,"_215":1724},{"_56":1746,"_26":1711,"_215":1719},[124],"Read the author’s division of AI work","Open the complete FPS project","Read the creator’s AI development disclosure","example:rhythm-master-windsurf","rhythm-master-windsurf","Rhythm Master 3D","四轨音乐节奏游戏，包含合成器曲目、难度选择、连击和