t into Windsurf, and links the exact rhythm-game repository in the same post.",[1789],{"_56":1790,"_26":1778,"_215":1791},"查看完整音游源码","The full game is rhythm.html, with procedural music and geometry rather than a separate asset download. Third-party libraries load from CDNs. No repository code license is declared.",[1793],{"_56":1794,"_26":1795,"_215":1796},"Download and run Rhythm Master 3D","https://github.com/frankjniu/rhythm-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No public hosted build was verified. Serve the downloaded directory and open rhythm.html. External CDNs supply Three.js and Tone.js, so internet access is needed; a click starts audio.",[1798],{"_56":1799,"_26":1786,"_215":-7},"阅读作者的开发流程",[1801,1802,1803,1804],"Download the repository and serve its directory with a local HTTP server, then open rhythm.html.","Choose a track and difficulty, start the game, and use D/F/J/K as notes reach the target zone.","Test combo scoring, Escape pause and the Space special mode before changing timing or difficulty.","Compare the single-file implementation with the creator’s original brief and debugging workflow.","Frank Niu 在作者帖子中链接这款游戏，并描述 Claude Sonnet 3.7 网页对话与 Windsurf 配合的流程：先生成初版，在对话中诊断问题，再由 Windsurf 应用修改。这是人工引导的开发案例，没有证据表明使用了 Claude Code 或一次自主运行完成。","Three.js · Tone.js · JavaScript",[1801,1802,1803,1804],{"_56":1815,"_26":1786,"_18":840},{"_56":1794,"_26":1795,"_18":225,"_215":1796},{"_56":1814,"_26":1778,"_215":1791,"_267":268},{"_56":1813,"_26":1786,"_215":1787},[124],"Read the author’s AI tools and prompt disclosure","Open the complete rhythm-game source","Read the creator’s build workflow","example:golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","Golden Hour Skatepark","在原创海边滑板场中压弯、起跳、翻板、滑杆、平衡，摔倒后重新上板。这是完整的第三人称滑板沙盒，显示短暂的技巧连段，支持切换日照，没有关卡或持久积分。","/zh/examples/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor/",{"_20":1817,"_22":1818,"_24":1819,"_114":1882,"_1116":1883,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":1880,"_9":1884,"_236":1885,"_19":1886,"_33":1887,"_212":1888,"_205":1889},[182