der passes, critic feedback and human playtests; docs/MAKING-OF.md provides a detailed account. Source-checked; performance and playability claims were not reproduced.",[1862],{"_56":1863,"_26":1864,"_215":1865},"查看完整滑板游戏项目","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park","Complete TypeScript game, procedural park code, runtime skater/crowd GLBs, textures, audio and source tools. CI uses Node 22 and pnpm 10.18.0; pnpm install then pnpm dev at 127.0.0.1:5188. Ports are fixed. No root LICENSE was found; CC0 media, Mixamo animations and dependencies keep separate terms.",[1867],{"_56":1868,"_26":1869,"_215":1870},"Play Golden Hour Skatepark","https://starknightt.github.io/skate-park/","Browser skating sandbox with keyboard, optional mouse/gamepad and touch controls. Press any key, click or tap to take over from the title-screen rider. Phone testing reported by the creator used desktop emulation; Firefox and desktop Safari remain untested.",[1872],{"_56":1873,"_26":1874,"_215":-7},"阅读实现与评审协作记录","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park/blob/main/docs/MAKING-OF.md",[1876,1877,1878,1879],"Play the park and test pushing, carving, one trick, a bail and recovery.","Read the making-of account and separate human feedback, agent implementation and third-party assets.","Use Node 22 with pnpm 10.18.0, then pnpm install and pnpm dev; inspect the collision mesh and character pipeline.","Ask an agent to adjust one movement or camera parameter, then compare transition riding, tricks and recovery across the park.","作者明确表示，Cursor 的 AI 代理通过实现与视觉评审轮次开发游戏，人类试玩推动了控制方式的修改。代码构建的场景与程序化滑行动作，配合 Cursor 生成画作，以及另行署名的 CC0 声音、纹理和 Mixamo 摔倒起身动画。",[1088],"Three.js · TypeScript",[1088],[1876,1877,1878,1879],{"_56":1892,"_26":1874,"_18":840},{"_56":1868,"_26":1869,"_18":315,"_215":1870},{"_56":1891,"_26":1864,"_267":268,"_215":1865},{"_56":1890,"_26":1859,"_215":1860},[124,1126],"Read the creator’s Cursor contribution account","Open the complete skating project","Read the builder-and-critic development acc