":102,"_26":103},[1932],{"_56":1933,"_26":1926,"_215":1934},"查看作者的 Codex 分工说明","Submitted by Olivia295, the source repository owner, with explicit human and model responsibilities; not a complete session transcript.",[1936],{"_56":1937,"_26":1938,"_215":1939},"查看完整生存游戏项目","https://github.com/Olivia295/SURGE-for-Oinja","Includes gameplay, physics, models, assets, translations and tests. Requires Node.js 22; run npm ci and npm run dev. No application server or API key is required.",[1941],{"_56":1942,"_26":1943,"_215":1944},"Play SURGE for Oinja","https://oinja-game.vercel.app/","Desktop WebGL and keyboard. WASD/arrows move, Space dodges, Q releases Sync Burst, and E interacts. Attacks are automatic. English and Chinese; no mobile touch controls.",[1946],{"_56":1947,"_26":1926,"_215":-7},"阅读作者的开发记录",[1949,1950,1951,1952],"Start a run and try movement, dodging and automatic attacks.","Read the creator’s contribution disclosure.","Inspect combat, progression and map code under src/surge/.","Change one ability combination and check its effect during a new run.","Olivia 使用 Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 实现战斗、能力联动、程序化环境、界面和调试。原创 Oinja 世界、创作方向和试玩反馈由作者提供；作品经过多轮会话和修改。","Three.js · Rapier 3D · TypeScript",[1949,1950,1951,1952],{"_56":1963,"_26":1926,"_18":235},{"_56":1942,"_26":1943,"_18":315,"_215":1944},{"_56":1962,"_26":1938,"_267":268,"_215":1939},{"_56":1961,"_26":1926,"_215":1934},[1335,124],"Read the creator’s Codex contribution statement","Open the complete survival-game project","Read the creator’s development account","example:project-plateau","project-plateau","Project Plateau: Proof Before Dark","受《失落的世界》启发的第一人称野外摄影探险：为史前动物取景，分配四张感光板，避开威胁，并在天色变暗前返回营地。","/zh/examples/project-plateau/",{"_20":1965,"_22":1966,"_24":1967,"_114":2027,"_1116":2028,"_96":119,"_251":2025,"_9":2029,"_236":2030,"_19":2031,"_33":2032,"_212":2033,"_205":2034,"_254":259},[1971,1972,1973,1974,1975,1976,1977,1978,1979,1980,1981,1982,1983,1984,1985,1986,1987,1988,1989,1990,1991],{"_54":22,"_58":1966,"_60":2