at-the-qa-record-admits-it-did-not-test","The author explains the recorded camera-to-result-and-restart route and its limits; GameMap is not claiming to have reproduced that complete route.",[2008],{"_56":2009,"_26":2010,"_215":2011},"查看完整探险游戏项目","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/tree/main/examples/project-plateau","Three.js/Vite game with local runtime models, textures, sound, source adaptation documents and QA inputs. Requires Node 22.12+ for local tooling. Blender scripts are asset-production sources, not required for normal play.",[2013],{"_56":2014,"_26":2015,"_215":2016},"Play Project Plateau","https://plateau.vibecoco.ai/","Desktop landscape browser with WebGL2, keyboard and mouse. Mobile devices may show the creator’s short recorded preview instead of the full game.",[2018],{"_56":2019,"_26":2010,"_215":-7},"查看探险游戏的开发与设计资料",[2021,2022,2023,2024],"Start the desktop expedition and learn movement, camera, crouching and return-to-camp controls.","Compare how subject framing, cover and photographic plates create choices from the novel’s expedition premise.","Read the build brief and verification record to separate a tested route from untested device, sound and optional encounter behavior.","For local play, enter examples/project-plateau/build/app, use Node 22.12+ to install dependencies, then run npm start; the committed runtime assets do not require Blender regeneration.","创作者将 Project Plateau 作为 NovelToGame 小说改编工作流案例，公开分析、概念、世界设计、美术、构建和 QA 各阶段。项目包含源码、已提交的模型纹理、资产生成脚本及一条测试路径的输入记录，没有明确指出具体编码客户端。",[1088],"Three.js · WebGL2",[1088],[2021,2022,2023,2024],{"_56":2037,"_26":2010,"_18":840},{"_56":2014,"_26":2015,"_18":315,"_215":2016},{"_56":2036,"_26":2010,"_215":2011,"_267":268},{"_56":2035,"_26":2005,"_215":2006},[124],"Read the creator’s adaptation and QA account","Open the full expedition project","Read the expedition build and design workspace","example:nagi-home-cowork","nagi-home-cowork","Nagi Home：小螃蟹的日常","照顾住在程序化小屋里的螃蟹 Nagi：放食物、扔球、邀请它使用家具，并从日记观察每日需求变化。这个安静的生活模拟器会保存进度。","/zh/examples/nagi-home-cowork/",{"_20":2039,"_22":2040,"_24":2041,"_114":2094,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":2093,"_9":2095,"_236":2096,"_19":2097,"_33":2098,"_212":2099,"_205":2100},[2046,2047,2048,2049,2050,2051,2052,2053,2054,2055,2056,2057,2058,2059,2060,2061,2062,2063,2064],"Nagi Home",{"_54":22,"_58":2040,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":118,"_58":2041,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":2094,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":252,"_58":253,"_60":254,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":249,"_58":2093,"_60":251,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":198,"_56":241,"_242":243,"_68":2088,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":237,"_68":2085,"_60":236,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":234,"_58":235,"_60":236,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":232,"_58":320,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":226,"_68":2081,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":224,"_58":315,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":219,"_68":2077,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":217,"_58":218,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":210,"_68":2073,"_60":212,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":203,"_68":2071,"_60":205,"_62":-7},{"_54":198,"_60":199,"_56":200,"_68":2069,"_64":65},{"_54":188,"_60":122,"_56":2065,"_79":2066,"_89":2067,"_33":2068,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_61":299},{"_54":55,"_60":185,"_56":186,"_58":1364,"_64":65},"The live Cowork-created simulation after placing food on the floor and throwing a ball.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/nagi-home-cowork.webp","Nagi the blue crab in a furnished three-dimensional home, with daily needs, food placement feedback and the ball activity.","https://tanuu5.github.io/nagi-home/",[2070],"Claude Cowork",[2072],{"_56":102,"_26":103},[2074],{"_56":1646,"_26":2075,"_215":2076},"https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home#readme","README credits explicitly name Claude Cowork and Claude Opus 5.5, with human planning/publishing attribution.",[2078],{"_56":889,"_26":2079,"_215":2080},"https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home","Complete single-file HTML with procedural Three.js scene, need/activity systems, dialogue and localStorage saves; MIT code. Three.js r169 is loaded from jsDelivr and fonts from Google Fonts, so a clean run requires those network resources. No coding-agent subscription is needed to play.",[2082],{"_56":2083,"_26":2068,"_215":2084},"试玩 Nagi Home","Japanese interface. Drag to orbit, wheel/pinch to zoom; the food and ball buttons trigger interactions. Normal food placement and ball throwing were checked in Chrome, including diary feedback. This is a life simulation without a combat or level-completion goal.",[2086],{"_56":2087,"_26":2075,"_215":-7},"查看作者的 Cowork 使用与模拟系统说明",[2089,2090,2091,2092],"Place food or throw the ball, then watch Nagi’s activity and diary change.","Read the single index.html to follow daily needs, activity selection, Three.js models and localStorage persistence.","Serve the repository with a static HTTP server or open its HTML in a browser; Three.js and fonts are fetched from external CDNs.","Change one need or activity rule, then check its effect at normal and accelerated time speeds.","作者明确说明，代码由 Claude Cowork 中的 Claude Opus 5.5 生成，并另行注明人类负责企划与发布。这里保留实际客户端 Cowork，不将其改写为 Claude Code；作者没有公开完整对话。","Three.js r169 · JavaScript",[2089,2090,2091,2092],{"_56":2102,"_26":2075,"_18":235},{"_56":2101,"_26":2068,"_18":315,"_215":2084},{"_56":915,"_26":2079,"_267":268,"_215":2080},{"_56":1676,"_26":2075,"_215":2076},[124],"Play Nagi Home","Read the creator’s Cowork and simulation notes","example:fishslop-claude","fishslop-claude","Fishslop","驾驶潜水器进入沉没的珊瑚礁，喂鱼、收集掉落的硬币，购买新鱼种和潜艇部件。声呐能短暂揭示平时隐形的 Veilfin。","/zh/examples/fishslop-claude/",{"_20":2104,"_22":2105,"_24":2106,"_114":2160,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":2159,"_9":2161,"_236":2162,"_19":2163,"_33":2164,"_212":2165,"_205":2166},[2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128],{"_54":22,"_58":2105,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":2106,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":2160,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":252,"_58":253,"_60":254,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":249,"_58":2159,"_60":251,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":198,"_56":241,"_242":243,"_68":2154,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":237,"_68":2150,"_60":236,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":234,"_58":2149,"_60":236,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":232,"_58":320,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":226,"_68":2145,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":224,"_58":315,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":219,"_68":2141,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":217,"_58":218,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":210,"_68":2136,"_60":212,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":203,"_68":2134,"_60":205,"_62":-7},{"_54":198,"_60":199,"_56":200,"_68":2133,"_64":65},{"_54":188,"_60":122,"_56":2129,"_79":2130,"_89":2131,"_33":2132,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_61":299},{"_54":55,"_60":185,"_56":186,"_58":1364,"_64":65},"The live reef after steering, feeding, coin feedback and sonar, using the low-quality preset.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/fishslop-claude.webp","A submarine in a three-dimensional reef with ruins, fish, feeding particles, coins and a recharging sonar display.","https://vasu-devs.github.io/FishSlop_Opus5.5/",[302],[2135],{"_56":102,"_26":103},[2137],{"_56":2138,"_26":2139,"_215":2140},"查看初次实现中的 AI 共同署名","https://github.com/vasu-devs/FishSlop_Opus5.5/commit/e7a7a2dd61b6da92f9512ccabafad13e1e9a3df4","Initial game implementation explicitly credits Claude Opus 5.5 as co-author; later fix commits repeat that credit. A model credit alone is not attributed to Claude Code.",[2142],{"_56":889,"_26":2143,"_215":2144},"https://github.com/vasu-devs/FishSlop_Opus5.5","Complete simulation, Three.js renderer, procedural assets, UI, audio, lockfile and tests. npm ci then npm run dev; the README’s Node 20.19+ does not cover every Node 22 version supported by its current Vite 8 dependency, so use Node 22.12+ or another compatible current runtime. No licence file was found; source availability is not a general reuse grant.",[2146],{"_56":2147,"_26":2132,"_215":2148},"试玩 Fishslop","WebGL2 with keyboard, mouse or touch. WASD steers, E/Q changes depth, Space feeds, F pings sonar and B opens the dock. The low-quality preset ?quality=low&scale=0.5 was used to check steering, feeding, coin feedback and sonar.","quickstart",[2151],{"_56":2152,"_26":2153,"_215":-7},"查看游戏规则与项目结构","https://github.com/vasu-devs/FishSlop_Opus5.5#readme",[2155,2156,2157,2158],"Dive in, steer with WASD, hold Space to feed fish and use F for sonar.","Compare the renderer-free simulation, feeding economy and save parser with the Three.js scene.","Use a Vite-compatible Node runtime, npm ci and npm run dev; Node 22.12+ meets the current Vite 8 requirement.","Change one fish or upgrade value, then check food, dropped coins, dock purchases and saved progress.","作者在初次实现与后续修复的提交中，明确将 Claude Opus 5.5 列为共同作者。这证明模型参与了开发，但未说明具体编码客户端，也不足以认定所有代码均由模型生成。鱼、珊瑚、纹理与音效由游戏代码在运行时生成。","Three.js · TypeScript · Web Audio",[2155,2156,2157,2158],{"_56":2169,"_26":2153,"_18":2149},{"_56":2168,"_26":2132,"_18":315,"_215":2148},{"_56":915,"_26":2143,"_267":268,"_215":2144},{"_56":2167,"_26":2139,"_215":2140},[124],"Read the initial AI-credited implementation","Play Fishslop","Read the game rules and project structure","example:pelican-bike-claude","pelican-bike-claude","Pelican on a Bike：鹈鹕骑单车","让戴着头盔的鹈鹕沿程序化海岸骑行，变道抓鱼、跳跃并解锁小成就。完整 Three.js 工程包含角色、单车、海洋、音频与昼夜系统。","/zh/examples/pelican-bike-claude/",{"_20":2171,"_22":2172,"_24":2173,"_114":330,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":2225,"_9":2226,"_236":2227,"_19":2228,"_33":2229,"_212":2230,"_205":2231},[2178,2179,2180,2181,2182,2183,2184,2185,2186,2187,2188,2189,2190,2191,2192,2193,2194,2195,2196],"Pelican on a Bike",{"_54":22,"_58":2172,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":118,"_58":2173,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":330,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":252,"_58":253,"_60":254,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":249,"_58":2225,"_60":251,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":198,"_56":241,"_242":243,"_68":2220,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":237,"_68":2217,"_60":236,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":234,"_58":395,"_60":236,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":232,"_58":320,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":226,"_68":2213,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":224,"_58":315,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":219,"_68":2209,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":217,"_58":218,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":210,"_68":2205,"_60":212,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":203,"_68":2202,"_60":205,"_62":-7},{"_54":198,"_60":199,"_56":200,"_68":2201,"_64":65},{"_54":188,"_60":122,"_56":2197,"_79":2198,"_89":2199,"_33":2200,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_61":299},{"_54":55,"_60":185,"_56":186,"_58":1364,"_64":65},"The live coastal ride after acceleration, a first jump and a camera change.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/pelican-bike-claude.webp","A white pelican riding a bicycle along a three-dimensional coast, with speed, distance, fish and achievement HUD.","https://claude-opus-5-5.riba2534.cn/",[519],[2203,2204],{"_56":519,"_26":520},{"_56":102,"_26":103},[2206],{"_56":1646,"_26":2207,"_215":2208},"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo#readme","Creator-published prompt and session summary, with exact Claude Code attribution. The model-led long-run tests described there were not repeated by GameMap.",[2210],{"_56":889,"_26":2211,"_215":2212},"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo/tree/main/pelican-bike","Complete pelican-bike source, build script and procedural assets. Run npm install and node build.mjs in that subdirectory, then open dist/index.html. The repository contains three distinct games; this case selects only the pelican game. Package metadata names ISC, but no repository-wide licence text is supplied.",[2214],{"_56":2215,"_26":2200,"_215":2216},"试玩鹈鹕骑单车","Keyboard and touch controls; W/S accelerate/brake, A/D change lanes, Space jumps and C changes camera. A muted entry is available. Desktop launch, acceleration, jump achievement and camera change were checked.",[2218],{"_56":2219,"_26":2207,"_215":-7},"阅读原始提示词与开发记录",[2221,2222,2223,2224],"Start a muted ride, accelerate with W/S, change lanes with A/D and jump with Space.","Compare the published one-sentence prompt with the pelican, bicycle, cloth, ocean and camera modules.","In pelican-bike, install dependencies and run node build.mjs; open the resulting dist/index.html in a browser.","Change one collection or cycling rule, then check movement, jump, score feedback and restart.","作者说明使用 Claude Code 中的 Claude Opus 5.5，从一句中文提示开始生成游戏。README 公开提示词，并记录模型进行浏览器测试及后续修复的过程；“人工未改代码”是作者自述，并非独立测量的创作比例。",[2221,2222,2223,2224],{"_56":2233,"_26":2207,"_18":395},{"_56":2232,"_26":2200,"_18":315,"_215":2216},{"_56":915,"_26":2211,"_267":268,"_215":2212},{"_56":1676,"_26":2207,"_215":2208},[550,124],"Play Pelican on a Bike","Read the original prompt and development account","example:core-business-claude","core-business-claude","Core Business","向下钻掘矿物，管理燃料与机体状态，回到地面商店出售矿产和升级。这是受 Motherload 启发的非商业采矿技术演示：Three.js 渲染 2.5D 世界，Blender 脚本制作三维资产。","/zh/examples/core-business-claude/",{"_20":2235,"_22":2236,"_24":2237,"_114":330,"_96":119,"_254":259,"_251":2289,"_9":2292,"_236":2293,"_19":2294,"_33":2295,"_212":2296,"_205":2297,"_1116":2298},[2241,2242,2243,2244,2245,2246,2247,2248,2249,2250,2251,2252,2253,2254,2255,2256,2257,2258,2259,2260],{"_54":22,"_58":2236,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":2237,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":256,"_58":330,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":198,"_56":1113,"_242":1114,"_68":2290,"_60":1116,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":95,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":252,"_58":253,"_60":254,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":249,"_58":2289,"_60":251,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":198,"_56":241,"_242":243,"_68":2284,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":237,"_68":2281,"_60":236,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":234,"_58":821,"_60":236,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":232,"_58":320,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":226,"_68":2277,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":224,"_58":315,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":219,"_68":2273,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":217,"_58":218,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":210,"_68":2269,"_60":212,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":203,"_68":2266,"_60":205,"_62":-7},{"_54":198,"_60":199,"_56":200,"_68":2265,"_64":65},{"_54":188,"_60":122,"_56":2261,"_79":2262,"_89":2263,"_33":2264,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_61":299},{"_54":55,"_60":185,"_56":186,"_58":1364,"_64":65},"The running author-hosted mining tech demo, captured with the Metal rendering backend.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/core-business-claude.webp","The Core Business mining vehicle in a three-dimensional side-view Mars scene, with fuel, hull, cargo, money and depth indicators.","https://leichtbier.github.io/core-business/",[302],[2267,2268],{"_56":102,"_26":103},{"_56":1088,"_26":1089},[2270],{"_56":1646,"_26":2271,"_215":2272},"https://github.com/Leichtbier/core-business#readme","The author explicitly separates Claude-generated work from ElevenLabs audio and credits Motherload/XGen Studios. This does not imply that Claude created the original game’s rules.",[2274],{"_56":889,"_26":2275,"_215":2276},"https://github.com/Leichtbier/core-business","Complete JavaScript game, vendored Three.js, committed GLBs, Blender source scripts, UI, audio and tests. Serve the root, e.g. python3 -m http.server 5173; Blender regeneration is unnecessary for normal play. Code is MIT with explicit exceptions: ElevenLabs audio is supplied for this project, not separate extraction or redistribution; see LICENSE.",[2278],{"_56":2279,"_26":2264,"_215":2280},"试玩 Core Business","WebGL browser, keyboard/pointer and touch controls. Initial graphics preparation stalled with the default headless renderer; Chrome with Metal reached normal play. After the opening transmission, brief movement/drilling input produced score 25 and fuel/depth feedback. Full mining progression and audio were not tested.",[2282],{"_56":2283,"_26":2271,"_215":-7},"查看采矿游戏的实现与资产流程",[2285,2286,2287,2288],"Start a new game and learn movement, downward drilling, fuel and return-to-surface shops.","Read the fixed-step simulation separately from the Three.js renderer and committed GLB models.","Serve the repository root with a static HTTP server; opening ES modules via file:// does not work.","Change one mineral or upgrade rule, then check drilling, selling, fuel use and save/reload.","作者将游戏代码、测试、纹理、翻译、模型和 Blender 生成脚本归于 Claude Opus 5.5，音效与音乐来自 ElevenLabs。该项目使用新资产重新实现 Motherload 风格的规则，并明确定位为非商业实验；未说明具体编码客户端。",[1088,2291],"ElevenLabs",[2285,2286,2287,2288],{"_56":2300,"_26":2271,"_18":840},{"_56":2299,"_26":2264,"_18":315,"_215":2280},{"_56":915,"_26":2275,"_267":268,"_215":2276},{"_56":1676,"_26":2271,"_215":2272},[124,1126],[1088,2291],"Play Core Business","Read the mining game’s implementation and asset pipeline","resource:threejs","resource","面向浏览器的 JavaScript 3D 渲染库，提供场景、相机、材质和资源加载器。","/zh/resources/",{"_20":124,"_2369":102,"_254":2370,"_54":2371,"_2368":2303,"_2363":2362,"_26":2325,"_66":2372,"_2346":2373,"_2337":2374,"_2333":2375,"_2330":187},[2308,2309,2310,2311,2312,2313,2314,2315,2316,2317,2318,2319,2320],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_54":22,"_58":102,"_60":2369,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":2303,"_60":2368,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":2366,"_58":2367,"_60":254,"_62":97,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":2364,"_58":2365,"_60":54,"_62":97,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":2361,"_58":2362,"_60":2363,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":219,"_68":2359,"_60":26,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":2351,"_68":2352,"_60":66,"_62":-7},{"_54":198,"_56":2344,"_242":1114,"_68":2345,"_60":2346,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":198,"_56":2335,"_242":1